Changes:
 tor (0.4.9.14-1~noble+1+tor41339.5) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Apply the tor#41339 HSDir defensive series (patches 0001-0013): HTTP
     and onion service descriptor hardening, MetricsPort counters for
     HSDir fetches and uploads and tunneled directory requests, and HSDir
     and BEGIN_DIR defenses, all off by default; restore
     doc/nofooter.conf.
